          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MTWA 1961 (driver hours, overtime, rest), Factories Act (warehouse shifts), PF (20+, 12%+12%), ESI (10+, ≤ Rs 21,000), TDS S.192 (salary) + S.194C (fleet owners), Maharashtra PT, Payment of Wages/Gratuity/Bonus, CLRA 1970 (20+ contract workers). JNPT/port operations may have additional compliance."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is PF and ESI mandatory for drivers and warehouse workers?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. PF for 20+ employees (all categories). ESI for 10+ employees, wages ≤ Rs 21,000 - covers most drivers, warehouse workers, loaders, helpers. Multi-state drivers: ESI Pehchan card for cashless across India. Even contract drivers on company rolls require PF/ESI. Remitted by 15th."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does logistics payroll cost in Mumbai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
