          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is driver salary structured?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MTWA structure: basic + DA + trip/outstation allowance (daily batta) + night halt + overtime at double wages (>8 hrs driving/day or >48 hrs/week). Variable trip components change monthly based on actual trips. Separate from office CTC. Long-haul vs local driver structures differ. Patron configures per MTWA."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
