<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Logistics & Transport Payroll in Mumbai - Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Logistics Payroll in Mumbai Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Logistics payroll covers <strong>driver wages per MTWA</strong> (8 hrs max driving, overtime double, trip/night halt allowance), <strong>warehouse shift payroll</strong> (Factories Act, Bhiwandi 24/7), <strong>JNPT CHA/CFS staff</strong>, <strong>PF/ESI</strong> (multi-state drivers), <strong>fleet owner TDS S.194C</strong> (1-2%), <strong>contract labour CLRA</strong>, <strong>gig rider advisory</strong> (SSC 2020), and <strong>Maharashtra min wages</strong>.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper" style="margin-top:16px;"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Governing Acts</td><td>MTWA 1961; Factories Act 1948; EPF/ESI Acts; IT Act S.192/S.194C; CLRA 1970; Maharashtra PT; SSC 2020</td></tr><tr><td>Applicable To</td><td>Trucking, 3PL warehouses, freight forwarders, CFS, couriers, delivery platforms, shipping agents</td></tr><tr><td>Timeline</td><td>Payroll by 7th; PF/ESI by 15th; TDS by 7th; 26Q quarterly for fleet owners</td></tr><tr><td>Cost From</td><td>Rs 5,000/month (small transport firm)</td></tr><tr><td>Key Challenge</td><td>Driver MTWA hours; Bhiwandi warehouse shifts; fleet owner 194C volume; contract labour S.21; multi-state PF</td></tr><tr><td>Authority</td><td>EPFO Mumbai; ESIC Mumbai; Labour Commissioner; RTO Mumbai; JNPT Customs</td></tr></tbody></table></div></p>
                </div>
                <p>Mumbai is India's logistics capital: <strong>JNPT (India's largest container port), Bhiwandi (100M+ sqft warehouses), Mumbai Port Trust, CONCOR ICD Mulund, Panvel transport nagar</strong>. Driver MTWA compliance, warehouse shifts, fleet owner TDS, contract labour, multi-state operations = unique payroll complexity. Learn more about <a href="#">Logistics Payroll across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Patron's Marine Lines office handles logistics-specific payroll with driver MTWA + warehouse Factories Act + fleet owner TDS. Also see <a href="/payroll-services">Payroll Services</a> and <a href="/accounting-services/mumbai">Accounting Services in Mumbai</a>.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
