<!-- SECTION 15A: LEGAL FRAMEWORK -->
<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal and Compliance Framework</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>MTWA 1961:</strong> Max 8 hrs driving/day, 48/week. Rest: 30 min after 5 hrs; 9 hrs between duties. Overtime double wages. Welfare for 100+ workers. Registers mandatory. Prosecution for non-compliance.</p><p><strong>Factories Act 1948:</strong> Warehouses 10+ (power) or 20+ (without). Max 48 hrs/week, 9 hrs/day. Overtime double. Leave: 1 day per 20 worked. Factory licence from Maharashtra Labour Dept. Inspector visits.</p><p><strong>PF/ESI:</strong> 20+ employees: PF 12%+12%, ECR by 15th. 10+ employees: ESI 3.25%+0.75% for ≤ Rs 21,000. Multi-state: ESI Pehchan card.</p><p><strong>S.194C:</strong> Fleet owner TDS 1% (individual) / 2% (company). Exemption: PAN + turnover &lt; Rs 1 Cr. 26Q + Form 16A.</p><p><strong>CLRA 1970:</strong> Principal employer Form I (20+ contract). S.21 liability. Contractor licence Form IV. Registers V/XII/XIII.</p><p><strong>Portals:</strong> <a href="https://epfindia.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">EPFO</a> | <a href="https://esic.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESIC</a> | <a href="https://incometaxindia.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Income Tax</a></p>

